  "excluded": [
    {
      "match": "test/functions/truncate.js",
      "reason": "truncate() is outside the Create subset (a recent addition that @types/semver 7.8.0 types but the brief's API list leaves out)."
    },
    {
      "match": "test/ranges/(gtr|ltr|outside|intersects|simplify|subset|to-comparators).js",
      "reason": "gtr, ltr, outside, intersects, simplifyRange, subset and toComparators are outside the Create subset (size budget)."
    },
    {
      "match": "test/classes/range.js › (ranges intersect|missing range parameter in range intersect)",
      "reason": "Range#intersects is outside the Create subset (size budget)."
    },
    {
      "match": "test/classes/comparator.js › (intersect comparators|intersect demands another comparator)",
      "reason": "Comparator#intersects is outside the Create subset (size budget)."
    },
    {
      "match": "test/classes/range.js › cache",
      "reason": "Checks that two Range objects share the same memoized comparator arrays, i.e. the private LRU parse cache."
    },
    {
      "match": "test/classes/range.js › formatted value is calculated lazily and cached",
      "reason": "Inspects the private `formatted` field before and after format(); the documented range/format()/toString() values are covered elsewhere."
    },
    {
      "match": "test/classes/range.js › range parsing covers every option combination",
      "reason": "Only counts rows of the range-parse fixture; it never calls the library, so it would award points to any module."
    },
    {
      "match": "test/classes/index.js",
      "reason": "Tests the semver/classes entry module of the package layout."
    },
    {
      "match": "test/index.js",
      "reason": "Tests the property descriptor of SEMVER_SPEC_VERSION on the package's CommonJS export object, which the grader's shim builds, and a constant outside the subset."
    },
    {
      "match": "test/preload.js",
      "reason": "Tests that the package's preload.js entry file re-exports index.js."
    },
    {
      "match": "test/map.js",
      "reason": "Inspects the repository's source and test file layout."
    },
    {
      "match": "test/bin/semver.js",
      "reason": "Spawns the semver command-line program."
    },
    {
      "match": "test/internal/(constants|debug|identifiers|lrucache|parse-options|re|trim-comparator-whitespace).js",
      "reason": "Unit tests of private internal modules (regular expressions, LRU cache, debug logger, option parsing, the comparator-whitespace scanner). Their observable effects are covered by the public-API tests and fuzz targets."
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Upstream runs these files with node-tap 16 (`tap`, devDependency ^16.0.0); each runs directly with node and prints TAP, so the grader uses runner node with tap 16.3.10. Tests require individual source modules (functions/*, classes/*, ranges/*, the package root and internal/constants); aliases point each at a one-line shim that returns that export of the module under test, and shims/constants.cjs supplies the published limits the fixtures read from the private internal/constants module. Create covers the SemVer, Comparator and Range classes (without intersects) plus parse, valid, clean, inc, diff, major, minor, patch, prerelease, compare, rcompare, compareLoose, compareBuild, sort, rsort, gt, gte, lt, lte, eq, neq, cmp, coerce, satisfies, maxSatisfying, minSatisfying, minVersion and validRange; minVersion and the Range/Comparator classes are included because the integration tests exercise them alongside satisfies and validRange. test/integration/comparator-normalization.js contributes about half of the Create test points."
}
